@startuml
title R2 - Parking reservation specializations (proposed)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description
[*] --> Pending : submit
Pending --> Confirmed : confirm [valid interval + atomic claim]
Pending --> [*] : reject / no record persisted
Confirmed --> Active : private arrival [start <= t < expiry]\n/ occupy bay once
Confirmed --> Completed : rental return [t < expiry + valid S3]\n/ consume hold; keep fleet occupancy
Confirmed --> Cancelled : owner cancel [t < expiry]\nor unusable resource / release claim only
Confirmed --> Expired : no arrival [t >= expiry]\n/ release claim only
Active --> Active : planned end or incident\n/ keep occupancy; flag for M5
Active --> Completed : private departure [charging stopped]\n/ release actual occupancy
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
note right of Confirmed
  Future calendar claim is not occupancy.
  Joint charger and bay use one parking space.
end note
note right of Completed
  Rental hold completes at drop-off.
  Fleet vehicle remains physically parked.
end note
@enduml
